 "How does Lumi Weather decide between 'bring an umbrella' and 'stay indoors'?": 1,
 "The app uses graduated rain penalties: 0–15% rain probability = no penalty; 15–30% = mild; 30–40% = moderate (umbrella recommended); 40–60% = substantial score reduction; 60–80% = score capped to 'short outing' level; 80%+ = capped to 'indoor'. For the 0–2 age group, thresholds are slightly stricter.": 1,
 "Can I see exactly when the rain is expected to stop today?": 1,
